 "Same seed → same starting noise → same image. That is why ComfyUI's <0/> widget makes runs reproducible (given identical settings and hardware, usually).": "",
 "▼ Dive in: <0>Guidance (CFG)</0>": "",
 "A diffusion model is trained to <0>predict the noise</0> in a noisy image. Generation runs it repeatedly, removing a little noise each step.": "",
 "Classifier-free guidance runs the model twice (with and without the prompt) and <0>extrapolates</0> toward the prompt: ε = ε_u + s·(ε_c − ε_u).": "",
 "To stay cheap, this all happens in a small <0>latent space</0> ({#}× fewer numbers than pixels), then a VAE decodes to pixels.": "",
 "Like an LLM, generation is <0>iterative</0> and the same network is called many times; unlike an LLM, all positions are refined in parallel, not left to right.": "",
 "Step counts (≈{#}–{#} typical) and guidance scales (≈{#}–{#} typical) are model- and sampler-dependent habits, not laws.": "",
